 Matrix multiplication is associative and  $A(BC)=(AB)C$ is always true.\n\n- Statement II is false. Matrix multiplication is distributive, so $A(B-C)=AB-AC,$ but $AC\\ne CA$ because matrix multiplication is not commutative in general.\n\n- Statement III  is false. Matrix multiplication is not commutative, so $CA\\ne AC$ in general.\n\nTherefore, only statement  I is true." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13993704/state.json" "file_sha256" "5847a665e3d8835b0f7b5fc99a5435f269aed8ba5aac82bc9c4cc21d5f2bcba6" "basis" 1055 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13993704/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-130455" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13993704/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "442e8807297dc2494084b95676f504ca51d5b48601a0223f31f0024d65b046fe" "basis" 1055 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13993704/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-130455" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13993704/state.json" "file_sha256" "5847a665e3d8835b0f7b5fc99a5435f269aed8ba5aac82bc9c4cc21d5f2bcba6" "basis" 1055 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13993704/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-130455" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/text "I and II only"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13993704/state.json" "file_sha256" "5847a665e3d8835b0f7b5fc99a5435f269aed8ba5aac82bc9c4cc21d5f2bcba6" "basis" 1055 "v